/**
 * How Paulownia, five-three-five (`gosan-no-kiri`) is constructed, in a line in each language: the text a crest's card shows beside its steps.
 * It is here, not on the crest's record, so that the manifest stays small; `crestConstruction()` loads it.
 *
 * @example
 * ```ts no-run
 * import { description } from "@johnmorrisdotca/kamon-crests/steps/gosan-no-kiri";
 *
 * console.log(description.en.length > 30, description.ja.endsWith("。")); // true true
 * ```
 */
const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"Three broad leaves below, the middle one hanging and the two beside it spread; above them three upright spikes, five florets on the middle one and three on each of the others. All three leaves hang from the small circle where they meet. The middle leaf is a rounded heart: its two upper edges are one compass width mirrored, and round its body are five scallops of one width. A side leaf is longer and narrower and made the same way; it is turned out until its midrib falls one for every two it runs, and it passes under the middle leaf. A white midrib runs straight from the small circle to the leaf's tip. On each side of it are four white veins. The first leaves the small circle and the other three leave the midrib lower down, one below the other. Each sweeps out and then down beside the leaf's edge, inside the vein above it, and stops on a circle about the small circle's centre, short of the edge. The upper veins are long and the lowest is short, and none reaches the tip. Each vein is the white between two circles two apart. A spike is a thin upright stalk that rises from behind the leaves, with one floret on its top and pairs of florets below it on short side stems, each clear of its neighbours and of the stalk. A floret is a bud of three discs: a round head and two round shoulders. A side stem is the band between two circles two apart: it leaves the stalk outwards and turns up into the bud. The left half is struck first and the right half is struck in place as its mirror.","ja":"下に広い葉を三枚、中央の葉は垂らし、左右の葉は広げます。その上に花穂を三本立て、中央に五つ、左右に三つずつ花をつけます。三枚の葉はどれも、葉が集まる小さな円から出ます。中央の葉は丸みのあるハート形です。上の左右の縁は同じ幅の円で、まわりに同じ幅の丸い裂片を五つ並べます。左右の葉は中央の葉より細長く、同じ作り方です。まっすぐな葉脈が2進むごとに1下がる向きまで外へ回し、中央の葉の下に入れます。どの葉にも、小さな円から葉先へ、白い葉脈を一本まっすぐ通します。その左右に、白い葉脈を四本ずつ入れます。一本目は小さな円から、残りの三本はまっすぐな葉脈の途中から、上から順に出します。どれも外へふくらんでから下へ向かい、葉の縁に沿って、一つ上の葉脈の内側を通ります。小さな円の中心から描いた円のところ、縁の手前で止めます。上の葉脈は長く、いちばん下の葉脈は短く、葉先には集まりません。白い葉脈はどれも、幅が2だけ違う二つの円の間のすき間です。花穂は、葉の後ろから立ち上がる細い茎です。茎の上に花を一つ、その下に左右一対ずつの花を、短い枝の先につけます。花と花の間、花と茎の間には、白いすき間をあけます。花は三つの円でできたつぼみの形で、丸い頭が一つ、丸い肩が二つです。枝は、幅が2だけ違う二つの円の間の帯で、茎から外へ出て、上へ曲がって花に入ります。左半分を先に作図し、右半分は左右反転させて、その場で作図します。"};

export default construction;
export { construction, description };
